1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,717
The sixth arc closed with a consultation and a regional register.

2
00:00:03,717 --> 00:00:08,926
“Imagine a castle of habits,” the physiotherapist said.

3
00:00:08,926 --> 00:00:24,948
“Every joint has a motive, and every motive has a remedy.” The minister, the official, and the player sat at the same table, and everyone at it had a different viewpoint about what to emphasize in the report.

4
00:00:24,948 --> 00:00:28,112
The visual evidence was distressful.

5
00:00:28,112 --> 00:00:45,873
A crack in the ambulance door, a lower spine injured in a fall, and a case of flu that had spread through the whole squad: the correspondence between the figures and the stories was exact, and it was suggestive of a remedy nobody wanted to fund.

6
00:00:45,873 --> 00:00:52,497
“Do not let a bad motive interfere with a good measure,” the doctor said.

7
00:00:52,497 --> 00:01:02,370
From the standpoint of immunity, the remedy was dull: sleep, a massage, a medicinal spoonful, and a jog in the park.

8
00:01:02,370 --> 00:01:13,102
Pork and feed had more prominence in the budget than a massage, and the vulnerability of the older members was the tiresome part of the argument.

9
00:01:13,102 --> 00:01:17,457
The destructive part was the provocation in the press.

10
00:01:17,457 --> 00:01:25,580
A single headline could expel a volunteer, cheer a rival, and refresh an old quarrel in a week.

11
00:01:25,580 --> 00:01:35,713
“You cannot extinguish a rumour with a labourious paragraph,” Maya wrote, and then corrected the spelling to laborious.

12
00:01:35,713 --> 00:01:46,615
The hurt was real and it was direct: a bony shoulder, an uncovering of the past, and a case of pneumonia that the hospital could not explain.

13
00:01:46,615 --> 00:01:59,088
The cohesive lesson was that a body is not a castle with one gate; it is a set of bridges, and every bridge has a limit that someone must discover before the ambulance does.

14
00:01:59,088 --> 00:02:07,701
I must ask what my job is here, the physiotherapist said: a service, a game, or a church?

15
00:02:07,701 --> 00:02:16,264
A vulnerable joint can disintegrate in a week, and a remedial hour is not a favour — it is the health of the whole squad.

16
00:02:16,264 --> 00:02:26,412
“Do not let the god of the timetable hit the table again,” she said, and the hospital sent its report to the ministry that afternoon.

17
00:02:26,412 --> 00:02:31,216
Thus the work of the ministry was to turn the report into a table.

18
00:02:31,216 --> 00:02:39,717
The club had learned to budget for rest; no one had yet learned to budget for the fear of stopping.
